    "description": "I am being discharged from hospital today after three months admission. But my transport home is now over 4.5hrs late and I am not yet even allocated a vehicle. I remain taking up a bed on the ward at the expense of the NHS. Meanwhile, this is what private outsourcing of transport does to the NHS:"
